Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:10.22,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}I think it's time to blow this scene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:12.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}Get everybody and their stuff together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:14.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,0)}Okay, three, two, one let's jam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.72,0:02:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you do that by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.14,0:02:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.23,0:02:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's be amiable. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.08,0:02:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't waste what our\Nwhimsical god has given us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.11,0:02:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,God? {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.34,0:02:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rather, for these guys,\Nit would be the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.66,0:02:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Want some? It's Dom Pérignon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.51,0:02:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.11,0:02:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,To this ship that has charmed the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world is going on\Nwith the showers in this place?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.62,0:03:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the fourth time!\NThe {\i1}fourth{\i0} time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.93,0:03:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Buddha gets upset\Nafter the third time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.41,0:03:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.53,0:03:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The shower broke, and only\Ncold water comes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.04,0:03:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And the faucet fell off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.05,0:03:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you know about it, fix it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.70,0:03:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.04,0:03:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do that any time you want—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.47,0:03:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We're busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.50,0:03:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just hang up!\NWhat if it's an emergency?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.86,0:03:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, all right. You'll be happy if I fix it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, he'll call you back. What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.50,0:03:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Fad. I'll tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.86,0:03:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Fad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.67,0:03:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say Fad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.06,0:03:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.79,0:03:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you fix that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.34,0:04:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I'll fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.36,0:04:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No, your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.85,0:04:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, reconstructive surgery\Ndoesn't cost that much nowadays, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This ship is my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.99,0:04:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And this arm is my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.23,0:04:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me what I need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.69,0:04:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you death row inmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.69,0:04:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to say, but the cruise to\Nthe prison on Pluto has been canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.94,0:04:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This ship will now enter a mystery tour—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.06,0:04:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think this ship\Nis enough for you to escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.37,0:04:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Stop wasting your time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.77,0:04:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If you surrender peacefully...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.87,0:04:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.35,0:04:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get so hotheaded, Dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.30,0:04:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man... there goes our precious hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.01,0:05:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting anyone tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.49,0:05:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you got a problem with that,\Nstep forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.92,0:05:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.17,0:05:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.02,0:05:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're... yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.81,0:05:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That assassin for the syndicate...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.09,0:05:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Udai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.75,0:05:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Caught you red-handed\Ntossing a cigarette butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.16,0:05:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be a fine of 20000 woolongs, Jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.90,0:05:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll need to collect\Nthat loan I gave you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.09,0:05:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,with 7 years' worth of interest\Nto cover it and then some.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.41,0:05:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you buy me that coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.30,0:05:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's long past the\Nstatute of limitations!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.46,0:06:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So you still think you're\Na gunman with a gun like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.97,0:06:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure is a waste of ISSP tax money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.11,0:06:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.32,0:06:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No, your salary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.52,0:06:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, really...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.29,0:06:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tenth day. It's a hard world\Nto live in for smokers, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.33,0:06:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... I never thought you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And, what was it that\Nyou wanted to tell me? {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.09,0:06:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There was trouble on the prison\Ntransport ship headed for Pluto.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.11,0:06:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That was six hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.01,0:06:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently there was\Nan electrical malfunction,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the prisoners took advantage\Nof it, and rioted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.49,0:06:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.39,0:06:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Udai is on that ship. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.92,0:06:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know where the ship went\Nafter it left the Ganymede Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.26,0:06:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The ISSP is frantically searching...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.21,0:07:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.68,0:07:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,don't get any stupid ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.48,0:07:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's out of your jurisdiction. {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.51,0:07:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You think it's a stupid idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.19,0:07:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason you quit being\Na cop was because of when...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.83,0:07:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now {\i1}that{\i0} is past the\Nstatute of limitations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.21,0:07:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If after all this, he lives on,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.29,0:07:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't that left arm of yours cry, Jet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.08,0:07:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That story doesn't interest me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.39,0:08:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet! I'll go around from this side!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.64,0:08:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.64,0:08:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Udai Taxim!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.83,0:08:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You are under arrest!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.64,0:08:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A trap?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.19,0:09:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What are ya gonna do? {10 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The guys from the ISSP are\Ngonna come any minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.49,0:09:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And the pilot's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.95,0:09:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna break through, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.92,0:09:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy for you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.37,0:09:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We only got enough weapons\Nfor self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.61,0:09:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What are ya gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.37,0:09:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they've set up a barricade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.34,0:09:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be better for us to attack
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.35,0:09:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and break through where they're thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.63,0:09:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you... steer this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.91,0:09:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a cop on Venus once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.89,0:09:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you're imprisoned for life?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.33,0:09:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Cops are human, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.16,0:09:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You got back?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.72,0:09:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.23,0:09:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous, so stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.55,0:10:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going out. Get souvenirs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.19,0:10:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed. {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.47,0:10:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't come back,\Nwater the bonsai for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.43,0:10:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.63,0:10:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Bonsai, wise guy, chicken pot pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.53,0:10:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lights shine bright in the many towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.24,0:10:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}HQ, do you read?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.73,0:10:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is Group D-7.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.70,0:10:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We have spotted the prison transport ship.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.68,0:10:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The ship is sending an SOS.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.85,0:10:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Apparently they ran into{\i0}\N{\i1}some mechanical trouble.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.45,0:10:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We are releasing a lifeboat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.03,0:10:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,On the boat are 4 officers and 12 inmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.29,0:10:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We're requesting a pickup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.77,0:11:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Number 12, Number 13, no response.{\i0}\N{\i1}We request emergency backup.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Repeat, we request emergency backup.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.44,0:11:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We have lost sight of the transport.{\i0}\N{\i1}Current location is seven-four-five.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.38,0:11:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Group D-7, initiate code ten-eight.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.17,0:11:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Repeat, we request emergency backup.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.09,0:11:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.58,0:11:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently the police don't know\Nwhere they went, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.19,0:11:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think their next move will be? {13 frame link}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.52,0:11:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If they are to hijack another ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.60,0:11:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be somewhere close to their original route. At a place where they can hide. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.20,0:11:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.25,0:11:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.86,0:11:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Europa. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.55,0:11:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Europa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.14,0:11:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.27,0:12:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If I was Udai, I would go back to Europa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.45,0:12:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Udai is already...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.01,0:12:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't contacted\Nthe syndicate in quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He is old-fashioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.89,0:12:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So much that he's not the right kind of\Nguy to live in this day and age.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.64,0:12:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll go back. I know it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.55,0:12:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The Black Dog that won't\Nlet go once he bites, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.89,0:12:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Europa it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.49,0:12:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're wrong, you're paying for fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.45,0:12:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! What the... Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.32,0:12:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What part of this is fixed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.09,0:12:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.97,0:12:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this? Jet's gonna have a fit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.96,0:12:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He asked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.06,0:12:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not comin' back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.34,0:12:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, just bring\Nsomething to wipe this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.87,0:12:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.58,0:13:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with him,\Nleaving his precious bonsai here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.60,0:13:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jet! What the hell is going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.85,0:13:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.41,0:13:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You seem to have done{\i0}\N{\i1}something outrageous.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.41,0:13:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We need a new ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.93,0:13:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There is no further relationship{\i0}\N{\i1}between us and Udai Taxim.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.90,0:13:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you betraying me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.21,0:13:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you want to feel that way, go ahead.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.89,0:13:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I have information.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.94,0:13:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That threat won't work anymore.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.82,0:13:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Times have changed...{\i0}\N{\i1}while you were in prison.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.55,0:13:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You win. He's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.74,0:13:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We should split up. I'll come\Naround from the other end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.91,0:13:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.32,0:13:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That ship doesn't have any decent weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.30,0:13:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how I work better\Nthan anyone else, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.59,0:14:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jet...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you quit being a bounty\Nhunter and pair up with me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.40,0:14:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll think about it if we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.02,0:14:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Heat source detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.67,0:14:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's the ISSP,\NI doubt they would come alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.15,0:14:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I found something good in the cargo bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.62,0:14:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And we have the perfect target.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.72,0:14:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Jet...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.11,0:14:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll approach them using this ice for cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.71,0:14:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay there until I signal—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.82,0:14:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.38,0:14:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who ya are,\Nbut we'll give ya a warm welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.36,0:15:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Here ya go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.09,0:15:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's got guts to come here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.28,0:16:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.24,0:16:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.92,0:16:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.90,0:16:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.43,0:16:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna put up with all of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.99,0:17:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You came all the way here to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.97,0:17:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't come here because I wanted to!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.63,0:18:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that, I came\Nout here just to greet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.88,0:18:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to come,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.11,0:18:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but something else\Nwanted to see you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.70,0:18:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.45,0:18:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The left arm that I lost! {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.30,0:18:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What a happy camper you are. {lead-out decreased by 1 frame}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.87,0:18:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You never knew anything, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.81,0:18:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.51,0:18:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't the one who shot you back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.25,0:18:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It was your partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.06,0:18:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet! I'll go around from this side!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.30,0:18:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.59,0:18:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was all planned out from the beginning.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.73,0:19:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To get rid of you, who was{\i0}\N{\i1}a threat to the syndicate.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.82,0:19:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Udai Taxim!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.00,0:19:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You are under arrest! {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.37,0:19:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You were long since betrayed. You were used.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.64,0:19:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A trap?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.32,0:19:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.47,0:19:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it because he was telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.54,0:19:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You came here to shut him up for good?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.09,0:19:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you answering me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.47,0:20:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It was your fault, Jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.78,0:20:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It ended up this way because\Nyou went in on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.20,0:20:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what happens to people who\Ngo against the syndicate, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.46,0:20:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Either they all quit like you... or they die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.91,0:20:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't live on with our pretty little ideals.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.11,0:20:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you betrayed me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.74,0:20:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and kept fooling me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.06,0:20:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to team up with\Nyou like back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.47,0:20:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for farewells, Jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.78,0:21:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Fad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.94,0:21:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.31,0:21:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you let me shoot on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.35,0:21:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I have... a smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.41,0:21:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess... I couldn't quit smoking...
