Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.51,0:23:54.25,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}if it ends after the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.40,0:24:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, the three of us\Nwill try to do the previews!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.27,0:24:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think we can do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.78,0:24:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We only have 30 seconds!\NIf you're too slow, it'll all be over!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.56,0:24:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are restless...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.15,0:24:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what kinda story is it next time?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.15,0:24:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't remember... {10 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.90,0:24:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!\NWe're already running out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.51,0:24:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, at least tell them the title!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.88,0:24:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Next episode...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.70,0:24:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.20,0:24:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We couldn't do it after all!
